  "details": "Description\n\nA serious and highly disruptive bug is occurring that forcibly closes the chat box.\n\nThe chat box is opened by pressing the Y key, but if the Y key is pressed while typing, the chat box is forcibly closed even though text is still being entered.\n\nAs a result, it is currently impossible to communicate properly through text chat.\n\nThis bug is extremely problematic and is preventing normal text-based communication.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nPressing the **Y key on the keyboard while typing in the chat box will always forcibly close the chat box, regardless of the situation.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: ユーザーインターフェース\n\n- Frequency: いつも\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1913-a070c3378e-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-16_12-57-11.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_b8e12f2f-6797-4575-b6f2-7e4fe3e67482/1/file)",
